                            <comment id="16663723" author="nsamelchev" created="Thu, 25 Oct 2018 13:15:14 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=zstan&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;zstan&quot;&gt;zstan&lt;/a&gt;,&#160;Hi,&lt;br/&gt;
the error can be reproduced locally. I&apos;ll investigate this issue. Moreover, deprecated GridStringLogger should be replaced with the ListeningLogger.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
