                            <comment id="16671849" author="ignitetcbot" created="Thu, 1 Nov 2018 16:42:09 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #D6F7C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;No blockers found!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=2209076&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAll&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity Run All Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16671853" author="nsamelchev" created="Thu, 1 Nov 2018 16:44:33 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I have fix IgniteDiagnosticMessagesTest.testLongRunningTx test.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Problem was that test can start PME after cache creating before start transactions. In this case, the &lt;em&gt;GridCachePartitionExchangeManager.dumpLongRunningOperations&lt;/em&gt; method ignores long operations. I have rewrite test and use the await method in the correct place.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Also, I have used new listening logger and optimized test duration. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;TC tests are OK. Mass runs 200 times also good.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16676993" author="githubbot" created="Tue, 6 Nov 2018 16:51:45 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user asfgit closed the pull request at:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/5081&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/5081&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16677007" author="agoncharuk" created="Tue, 6 Nov 2018 17:00:25 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Thanks, &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=NSAmelchev&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;NSAmelchev&quot;&gt;NSAmelchev&lt;/a&gt;, merged your changes to master.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
